# Typography & Readability Defaults

## Paragraph line length

Use a **max-width on paragraph containers of ~65–75ch** (e.g. `70ch`) to keep line length in a comfortable range for reading.

- In base CSS: `p { max-width: 70ch; }` (along with `text-base` and `leading-relaxed`).
- Or apply a utility/wrapper class with `max-width: 70ch` to reading-content containers.

This is the preferred default for body copy readability in this project and in new projects unless overridden.
